WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.450
Let's battle.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:07.620
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon attacks 
Idaten the Conqueror Star.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.790
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.140
The winner is Yuya Sakaki.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.840
Nice, Yuya.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.060
He's so scary that I'm shivering.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.340
Yuya.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.810
He's like a different person.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.840
Kachidoki!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.980
Are you okay?

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:53.080
What am I feeling?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:01:01.080
Here are today's results for Maiami 
Championship's Junior Youth Class.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:04.350
Yuya Sakaki has Ute's card.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:06.910
Where are you going?

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.260
To meet him!

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.820
Not right now.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:16.890
No matter your reasons, you will not do 
anything that would hinder this tournament.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:25.560
Don't forget what I'm trying 
to do with this tournament.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.260
I'll have a guard keep an eye on Kurosaki.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.650
There's a sudden change of plans!

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:48.110
The third match is next, but since 
LDS's Hokuto Shijima is absent,

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:53.390
Kirigakure Cooking School's 
Michio Mokota wins by default!

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.750
Absent?

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:56.360
President!

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:02.570
About three hours ago, we detected a high 
level summoning signal in Maiami City.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.540
What's the summoning method?

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.480
Fusion.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.240
We have security camera 
footage of the location.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.510
Please look.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:14.170
Xyz Course's Hokuto Shijima?

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:25.600
Rewind it.

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.130
Stop.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:32.330
That's...

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.070
You Show School's...

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:43.880
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:49.070
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:52.080
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.350
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.100
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.770
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:04.570
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:15.690
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:21.160
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:26.760
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:30.900
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:34.840
Repeating Up/Down

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.170
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:44.450
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.880
Because I don't want to give up

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:52.890
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:59.960
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:10.470
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:13.180
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.880
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.670
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.420
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:30.980
Academia's Warrior

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:35.400
It's the seventh day of 
the Maiami Championship!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:40.760
The duel between You Show 
School's Yuzu Hiiragi

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:45.730
and Duelie Club's Mikiyo Naname 
is about to begin at Stadium #2!

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.940
Yuzu!

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.140
Get fired up!  Get your blood boiling!

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.120
Do your best!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.440
Promise to make me shiver!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.040
We believe in you!

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.010
Naname!

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.950
Mikiyo!  Mikiyo!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.800
It's duel time.  Is everyone ready?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.440
Be the best you can be!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.160
And have the best smiles!

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.830
Duelie Club go!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:25.220
Naname!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.240
Right on!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:32.880
To all my fans, thanks for coming!

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:36.880
I'll Special Summon everyone's hearts today!

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.940
That's why she's an idol duelist.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.930
She can fire up her fans easily.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.830
But I'm You Show School's spokeswoman.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.040
I'll show them real entertainment dueling!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.150
The mysterious girl is at Stadium #1.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:03.040
Yuzu Hiiragi is about to start 
her match at Stadium #2.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:07.100
She's definitely the girl from yesterday.

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.350
Stadium #1 is National Maiami Stadium.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.280
Yu Sakuragi, last year's 
Junior Youth champion

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:17.020
who has advanced to Youth, 
will have his match there.

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.060
She's targeting Yu Sakuragi.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:22.760
Where are you going?

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.240
To Maiami Stadium.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.660
Make sure Kurosaki doesn't go there.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.160
Understood.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.610
I attack with Gellenduo!  Angel Loop!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.700
I end my turn.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.060
This is a close match!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.390
They're about equal so far!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.080
Even if our dueling skills are equal,

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:57.170
as long as my fans support me, I have 
the strength of a hundred people!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.620
Everyone, please enjoy yourselves today!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.540
Hundred people?  Whatever!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:09.640
I'll entertain everyone 
with the greatest dueling!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.100
Stay calm and get fired up, Yuzu!

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:15.610
My hot-blooded power is 
equal to a hundred people!

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:21.090
The man Gongenzaka will also cheer 
with the chivalry of a hundred men!

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:25.220
Together, you have the power 
of two hundred people!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.560
Hooray!

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.120
Hooray...

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.510
Yesterday's duel...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:40.440
Why did that happen?

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:46.840
Sakuragi Xyz Summoned Hierophant of Prophecy.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:49.110
That was the deciding factor.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.460
Are you the ones who called me?

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.910
I'm the one who called you.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.640
President?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.940
Sorry.  You can leave now.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.420
You dueled well today.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.330
I expect big things from you.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.640
Thank you very much.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:27.720
Wait!

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:31.970
Let me go!

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:33.060
Hurry up and go!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.500
If you're going to interfere, 
I'll finish you first!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.700
I'll do it.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.140
Stay back, Barrett!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:53.380
The Professor ordered me 
to protect you from danger.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.320
When you say Professor, 
do you mean Leo Akaba?

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.760
That means you're...

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:19.000
Seal this area.  Don't let anyone 
enter until I contact you.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.260
Duel!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:31.860
Whoever acts first gains the 
advantage, so I go first.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:35.490
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Beastborg Fusioner!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:40.460
I can Fusion Summon a Beastborg 
monster once per turn!

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:42.430
I knew it.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:49.120
I fuse Panther Warrior and 
Dark Sentinel from my hand!

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.290
Ferocious black panther,

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:55.640
merge with the guardian of the 
holy darkness and give a new roar!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.380
Fusion Summon!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:09:59.110
Appear.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.550
Beastborg Panther Predator!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.220
The summoning signal is on the same 
level as the one we detected yesterday.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:12.960
Panther Predator's effect activates!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:18.530
Once per turn, you take damage 
equal to half its attack points!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.740
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.760
He makes sure to take away life 
points from the first turn.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.710
That's an unoriginal strategy.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:37.680
President, the opponent is definitely 
a duelist from Fusion Dimension.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.530
I know.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.890
My turn.  I draw!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:47.830
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Dark Contract with the Swamp King!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:52.900
I take 1000 points of damage 
during each of my Standby Phases.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.730
Oh, you're damaging yourself?

00:10:56.030 --> 00:11:03.400
But in exchange, I can Fusion Summon a 
Fiend-Type Fusion Monster once per turn.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:08.210
I fuse D/D Lilith and D/D Cerberus!

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:12.170
Hell's guard dog bares its fangs.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.850
The enchantress who wanders the dark night!

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.320
Within the swirling light 
of the realm of the dead,

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.600
become one and give birth to the new king!

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.660
Fusion Summon!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:27.260
Be born, D/D/D Flame King Genghis!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:34.870
Let's battle!  Flame King Genghis 
attacks Panther Predator!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.910
Fire Stroke!

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:49.790
However, I activated the Continuous Trap 
Beastborg Medal of the Shield before the battle.

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:57.320
This card gains one Medal Counter for every 
100 points of battle damage that I take.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.600
When Panther Predator is destroyed,

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:04.740
I can Special Summon the monsters that were 
used to Fusion Summon it from the graveyard!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:09.760
I Special Summon Panther 
Warrior and Dark Sentinel!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.100
You took their destruction 
into consideration.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.680
I end my turn.

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:28.260
I'm not afraid to take risks to win.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.320
It seems you've had actual combat experience.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:52.250
Even if you try to stop 
me, I'm going to Standard.

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.530
I won't stop you.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.960
I'm going with you.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:02.190
You're the first monitor that 
hasn't tried to stop me.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.460
I know the risks.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:11.130
In order to return to the battlefield, 
I must produce results in combat.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.870
My turn!

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:18.080
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Beastborg Fusioner's effect again.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:22.050
I use Panther Warrior and Dark 
Sentinel to Fusion Summon.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:26.020
Appear again, Panther Predator!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:31.490
I activate the Continuous Trap Beastborg 
Medal of the Shield's effect!

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.290
By sending this card to the graveyard,

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:42.880
my Beastborg gains 100 attack points 
for every Medal Counter on it!

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.800
Its attack points are now equal to Genghis!

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:50.260
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Beastborg Medal of the Blade.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:55.550
It gains one Medal Counter for every 
100 points of damage that I deal you.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.020
You really love medals.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.200
I'm a warrior.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.170
The amount of medals symbolizes 
a warrior's honor!

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.700
Due to Panther Predator's effect again,

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.360
you take damage equal to 
half its attack points!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:19.770
I activate the Continuous Trap Beastborg 
Medal of the Blade's effect!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.680
By sending this card to the graveyard,

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:29.680
my Beastborg gains 100 attack points 
for every Medal Counter on it!

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:33.150
It instantly has 1000 more attack points!

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:38.150
Let's battle!  Panther Predator 
attacks Flame King Genghis!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.130
Industrial Savage!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:49.570
Like I thought, he has plenty 
of combat experience.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.770
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:59.220
Due to the Continuous Spell Dark Contract 
with the Swamp King's effect...

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:05.370
...you take 1000 points of damage 
during your Standby Phase next turn.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.690
Exactly.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.290
My turn.  I draw!

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:20.270
Due to the Continuous Spell Dark 
Contract with the Swamp King's effect,

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.270
I take 1000 points of damage.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:31.440
How admirable.  You should get a medal.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.080
I don't need one.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:39.550
But this damage has decided the match, 
warrior from the Fusion Dimension!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:40.750
What?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:59.160
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 D/D 
Savant Galilei and Scale 10 D/D Savant Kepler!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:10.630
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 9 simultaneously!

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:14.830
The great power that sways my soul,

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:18.660
reside in my body and become the new 
light that cuts through the darkness!

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:20.660
Pendulum Summon!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:24.180
Appear, my monsters!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:29.370
The proud warrior D/D Proud Chevalier!

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:33.840
The pot that seals away 
catastrophe!  D/D Pandora!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.810
Pendulum Summon?

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:36.940
I'm not done!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:43.760
I overlay Level 5 D/D Proud 
Chevalier and D/D Pandora!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:51.420
Gifted with a heroic name, shoot everything 
in existence with profound justice!

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.760
Xyz Summon!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:59.500
Descend, Rank 5 D/D/D Marksman King Tell!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.700
He used Xyz after Pendulum?

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.000
Marksman King Tell's effect!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:10.020
When I take damage from a Contract, 
by using one Overlay Unit that turn...

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:16.450
...your monster loses 1000 attack points, 
and you take 1000 points of damage!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:20.550
That's why you intentionally took damage.

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.020
Piercing Arrow!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:39.140
I also use the remaining 
Overlay Unit.  Piercing Arrow!

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.280
It's not over yet!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:56.330
The Continuous Spell Dark Contract 
with the Swamp King's other effect!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.290
By banishing monsters that are needed 
to Fusion Summon from the graveyard,

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:02.490
I can Fusion Summon a D/D monster!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.750
What?

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:10.460
I banish D/D Proud Chevalier and D/D Pandora 
from the graveyard to fuse them together!

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:15.120
Proud knight, melt into the pot 
that has sealed away catastrophe

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.210
and be reborn as a true king!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.940
Fusion Summon!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.040
Come out, the king with god's authority!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:25.060
D/D/D Oracle King d'Arc!

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:31.520
Let's battle!  D/D/D Oracle King 
d'Arc attacks Panther Predator!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.520
I won't fall so easily!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.000
I activate the trap card 
Beastborg Medal of Honor!

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.930
It destroys a Beastborg Fusion Monster

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:43.470
and Special Summons the monsters used 
to Fusion Summon it from the graveyard!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.440
I destroy Panther Predator!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:51.110
I Special Summon Panther 
Warrior and Dark Sentinel!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:56.380
Then I activate the trap card 
Beastborg Medal of Honor's effect!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:01.630
We both take damage equal to the 
total attack points of the monsters

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.680
that were Special Summoned by this card!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:08.930
We both take 3500 points of damage, 
so I'll take you down with me!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.070
I won't allow that.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:18.000
I activate D/D/D Oracle King d'Arc's effect!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:23.410
It negates effect damage, and I gain 
life points equal to that amount.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.540
Life Elation!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:29.520
I regain 7000 life points.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:30.980
No way!

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.950
Resume the battle!  Go, d'Arc!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.320
Oracle Charge!

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.280
This is the end!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:50.360
D/D/D Marksman King Tell 
attacks Dark Sentinel!

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.320
Forbidden Break Shot!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:54.470
It vanished?

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.160
What a fierce battle!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.640
Naname has taken the lead!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:18.920
My turn!

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.960
The match isn't over yet.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:24.340
Entertainment dueling is about 
enjoying this situation!

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.340
I draw!

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:34.560
I summon Crystal Rose!

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:39.360
I can treat this card as 
Mozarta the Melodious Maestra!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:49.930
Bring smiles to the future.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.720
The angel's song!  The supreme genius!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.100
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:20:58.700 --> 00:20:59.910
Fusion Summon!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.200
Take the stage with the song of victory!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:07.850
Bloom Diva the Melodious Choir!

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.500
This is what I was waiting for!

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:17.000
Everyone is smiling.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.760
That's right.  This is dueling.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.290
What have I been doing?

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.770
Let's battle!  Bloom Diva attacks Wingweaver!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.730
Reflect Shout!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.940
It's finally over!

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.370
The winner is Hiiragi!

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:42.660
It was a wonderful duel!

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:45.920
Yuzu!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:49.220
That fired me up!

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:05.300
Wait, Serena.

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:35.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:42.660
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.960
I always believe

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:51.480
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.110
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:05.750
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:12.620
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:19.290
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:23.360
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:52.200
Sora vanished that night.

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:56.250
Syun Kurosaki must know the truth,

00:23:56.480 --> 00:24:00.680
but even though the Maiami Championship's 
second round is over, I still haven't seen him.

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:06.400
For the first time in three 
years, Reiji Akaba meets Serena,

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:10.000
the girl from the Fusion 
Dimension who looks like Yuzu.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:15.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
The Land of Ambition  Duel Academia

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:17.480
The fun is only getting started!
